    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b16082ebd90f2788326c5b05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“必定达成决定的目标”的\n吉兆正在日夜努力训练。\n荒漠英雄深信她一定能够赢得“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "180903fd7d3df673265be7e8fe7ef983e24e7f0de099165b1d48b6fe5f4d10f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
