      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0630321a75d7b7ff8e1ee5f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而……结果却是第二名。\n看到深信的英雄败北，\n荒漠英雄受到巨大打击。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a71fa2e450c490f234ace4166c18299319132b82a62e4822b9d3a955aab9e7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cec7b4c2700282c285c01d19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:440cad63c0a847130eed789c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过吉兆却在采访中如此回答。\n“往后仍照常，只须达成应达成的任务”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4320bc206ebf6fd0cccd0360b5dd8179d777e85bb2f2cb3e376668015ce3b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a8b9506ac480b980cb096a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f3915d02cc41407aa5d725c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使败北，\n她手中之剑的尖端仍然一如往常地专注指向未来。\n那模样为荒漠英雄带来了力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe346f68b6e3e2527d1bc328d8be919925c57d4b6fcd5cb8ba2f54ba134d734",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a953d096a0f97702df935e26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67026ee0edea96b85c5cfa12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄决心成为“永不动摇”的英雄，\n成为指引人们的路标──\n期许自己挥剑时能够给予人们勇气与希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71e0fc35d5a1fe2800f4bc87eafbb53556893aeeab341c1dc427d7a44714ae2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2e74036bebdda90daca3eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英雄的条件",
      "source_fingerprint": "98353a0e5f76666bc111cf60bccbdac2021b49e3c03ee300b7c67fa321696878",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047402.json",
