    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:362ff8a8ba1dfcd84838d244",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ffed5fcf69bab03169f38d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄告诉吉兆\n自己即将参赛“有马纪念”。\n此时她得知对方内心“对引退毫无留恋”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "00bb07daf0a54386945123f81b818a120c0a0cd9dcdbf55fd07f58e54de77b95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f76f6d52a2aae3a89d95424",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ce546e2b951283a5b47b774",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄终于说出了真心话。\n她不想让自己在对方心中\n从头到尾都只是个普通过客。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f1fd25724436683f4c7356360d6ade4713f790ff2de7f0d6b22501059d85f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869b4ddad639c47125f5a75e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04ae7aa579631119c98acbe2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我绝对会赢得“有马纪念”。\n我要成为──你唯一的留恋。\n她做出了这番宣言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55e226d3940b20251933d851155e8b6e3f662b5cdee87fddc8dea6ccf0a50575",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd7f113705359cda0f9918b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我真正想成为的",
      "source_fingerprint": "3250ceb211e72622ec8408dd1a4bee5cbcf43cb3b48ef84f7b059030cc1ec068",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d7c5dc2d04dd32fd772c471",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff3c4e6fdd5ee483b449262c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆开口对荒漠英雄说出了这番话。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "40863e71c53481b0add1245687d21a734c84c5b4dff595fe95fd4defba05594d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a897463b74b199345ed694f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace6e10d7f979ed06436c72e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你那为了获得英雄资格坚持奔跑的\n坚强意志是道耀眼的光芒。我想再近距离看一次\n那道光芒。所以──我要参赛“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5d26c3e4f3848d9b0e714a51214b1b29e13cb41078b0d7d86ed882223cb26f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6300f9c250cf166f461deaac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcdff539e917593566cd4122",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄心中大受震撼。\n并发誓即使赌上一切\n也非得达成“秋古马三冠”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d334c371000e82e61a69b3216475c705a97c1b32a08da297bd1870842afd6d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909bd8e7930f12274f82a3ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迟来的英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "9550d982c2d6931d15d269a8abbe6bebdbe1f4bac6091b55f8d791d25af2d509",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd73996d6629269b23bbcb8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047405.json",
      "json_path": [
