    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6def536b90cd4f503e8e05c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训开始了。\n荒漠英雄尚未从“日本德比”的热度中冷却。\n不过──“菊花赏”已经近在眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "698695879c54a0d784c90ce884fed7ae765a06cc5d519d4d5cefe88e655ad9b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fddf38ff1e00091fc1b2cae4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab431c0a231793cc60e7832b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是“最强的赛马娘”才能够获胜的舞台。\n荒漠英雄绷紧精神，\n要求进行最严苛的锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dc4492af63378ca7a1b08a7180c50b53e4c7d24f9b4e761b64de3c9ddc270b5",
